    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκ-τός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be received</i> or <i>accepled, acceptable,</i>
